EQ7kNvwEVQylv&_nc_oc=AdlsxehpyGgvToRXvtSV0G_RPB8aYg3V3hzl9fz_q1xCr7-23oWp61HR9VFH3oOML8Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvONUEL9Kxs0Haug6cghcjWhg4Xkx8vLHQOXoYmNlbxLg&oe=69A2DECC"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "1152286369897580", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619588_1152286373230913_5226934959439945484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gV4Ci92IxDkQ7kNvwFqn3tF&_nc_oc=AdnJG9LxRiHfH6i9bzqWTWb9gZf3ih2fbuIVGE6WafHyBqlIwJnY9qmEZHGxSkNTMng&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfseV7tclBDKmkVeOhW79ztLI871vT81iaQAc2_Y7gsjqA&oe=69A2CF45"}, {"file_name": "\u622a\u56fe1.png", "id": "684521228053278", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619485_684521231386611_6623603831782279089_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Dnh_oYqlWxkQ7kNvwF4QznO&_nc_oc=AdnPCKL1MUWtK3qXm6c9tnM_JsNnQy8-F7AS6j0gNQd4IXKcwIQDhCiRnb3wDzf7m-U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs5K_jCoUFXf1DCxezDqyraIDzs4AS4apCERG5mteIueQ&oe=69A2E099"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1388131016268349", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822045_1388131019601682_113874591060992121_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5Laoh0H_Ad0Q7kNvwFH0Ypq&_nc_oc=AdmEd1BLUGlsANGNEeiu7O2Rz7F8FEXCWQcEZShrsTaonaP48ARdFZrlWoLJt0Oazqs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft5G_ysugJ0P2JPqo3wh54xllbKpU0slp-sP_ubv6yB5A&oe=69A2F65D"}, {"file_name": "444.png", "id": "779906775198861", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314659_779906778532194_1744895043394346610_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RXicpvcYfzMQ7kNvwG-6KKq&_nc_oc=Adm8eRtxtLxc5CJGPv93bY4N_lHM4TWcBJdm_nrf7ugJaS7kjcfGlInGkJH6w_URoFs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv3_DySj4fek4AqGgjZHRCpbnhdEaSRVF3kuHHcnnm5Iw&oe=69A2D354"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1950760892146935", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618297_1950760898813601_5680159503057088351_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0ub5ArfoWBoQ7kNvwHFQmiU&_nc_oc=AdkUYLo1ekEFyCxzWt13GWipLCSNgO3P03IK-UpiMBbzzv3Gdij8q7iU_DIGjYi82Ds&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsFeSw-tKJsJoXyRq55NwAq9EohwrpUEBXiQv0mtp-Yxg&oe=69A2EBEC"}, "display_name": "Umbrella Up", "keywords": ["horror", "adventure", "simulator", "sandbox", "climb"], "long_description": "# \ud83c\udf83 **Umbrella Up: Horror Mode** \u2602\ufe0f\ud83d\udc80\n\n**You think your umbrellas can protect you?**\nThink again.\n\nWelcome to **Umbrella Up: Horror Mode** \u2014 where a *cute snowman* turns into a *survivor in the dark*. \ud83c\udf2b\ufe0f\n\nThe lights are out. The park\u2019s empty.\nSomething\u2019s breathing right behind you. \ud83d\udc40\nUse your umbrellas to glide, hide, and escape \u2014\nand try to survive inside this cursed amusement park.\n{1094397659433664}\nEvery shadow hides a secret.\nEvery sound could be your last warning.\nFog, flickering lights, distant laughter...\nEverything feels *off*. \ud83d\udd26\ud83d\udc7b\n\n**Just remember \u2014 don\u2019t let the lights go out.**\nWhen they do\u2026 you\u2019ll find out what\u2019s really waiting for you.\n\n## \ud83d\udc80 **Game Features**\n\n- **Haunted Theme Park Map** \u2014 thicker fog, jump scares, dynamic lighting\n- **Battery Panic System** \u2014 find batteries before your flashlight dies! \ud83d\udd0b\n- **Creepy & Funny Skins** \u2014 from *Ghost Umbrellas* to *Cursed Snowmen*\n- **Hidden Stories & Easter Eggs** \u2014 only the brave will uncover them\n\n\ud83c\udf19 **Dare to open your umbrella in the dark?**\n{1387940046384292}", "short_description": "This ain\u2019t your chill VR game anymore \u2014 it\u2019s pure chaos! \ud83d\udca5\nPop open your umbrella \ud83c\udf02 and jump into the storm! \ud83e\ude82\n\n\ud83c\udf02 One tool, endless tricks:\n\ud83e\uddd7 Climb \uff5c\ud83e\udebd Glide \uff5c\ud